    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-ξενος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>alien to guests,
				inhospitable,</i> stronger than 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄξενος, ὅρμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					196
				</span></i>
			(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.
			loci, <i>far from</i> a country, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆσδε γῆς ἀπόξενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1282
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				1042
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦδ᾽ ἀ. πέδου</span>”
				<i>banished from . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					884
				</span></i>
			.</div>
